<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Carlton upped at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carlton upped at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media group Carlton Communications Plc was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The move came in a review of prospects for UK digital terrestial television. BZW also repeated a &quot;buy&quot; rating on British Sky Broadcasting Plc and Granada Group Plc, sources said.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
